        <mxCell id="legend" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=13;align=left;spacing=10" value="&lt;b&gt;Flow:&lt;/b&gt; Client → Global LB → API Gateway → Microservices → Cache/DB. For playback, client gets authorization/manifest from Playback Service, then video segments are delivered primarily through CDN. Content follows Ingest → Transcode → Package/DRM → Origin → CDN. Playback events flow asynchronously through Kafka to analytics/ML." vertex="1">
